---
// A `[starlight-blog] ... already have a MarkdownContent override` warning
// during build is expected: it comes from composing starlight-blog and
// starlight-image-zoom's overrides by hand below, which is intentional.
// Both starlight-blog and starlight-image-zoom want to own the
// `MarkdownContent` override (blog metadata/footer on post pages, and the
// click-to-zoom behavior everywhere). Composing them by hand here keeps
// both working: render the zoom behavior, then delegate to starlight-blog's
// own override (which already falls back to Starlight's default on
// non-blog pages).
import BlogMarkdownContent from 'starlight-blog/overrides/MarkdownContent.astro';
import ImageZoom from 'starlight-image-zoom/components/ImageZoom.astro';
---

<ImageZoom />
<BlogMarkdownContent><slot /></BlogMarkdownContent>
